# Derived intermediates from tools/build-assets.py. art/raw/ is already
# ignored repo-wide; this is the second half of the same reasoning -- work/
# holds the seam-blended and cropped stages between a raw generation and the
# shipped asset, and every one of them is reproducible by re-running the
# script. public/assets/ is what the game loads and stays tracked.
art/work/
